#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/lcms.xml:29
msgid ""
"The <application>Little CMS</application> library is used by other programs "
"to provide color management facilities."
msgstr ""
"A biblioteca <application>Little CMS</application> é usada por outros "
"aplicativos para fornecer recursos de gerenciamento de cores."

